  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in chokepoint attacks raises trade‑insurance and counterparty risk, prompting foreign banks and insurers to scale back trade finance, correspondent lending and credit lines, weakening external financial linkages.</data>
