  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A noticeable rise in perceived maritime security threats increases political pressure to secure critical supply chains and dual-use technologies, prompting regulators to propose tighter export controls, oversight and other AI-targeted constraints.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">red_sea_hormuz_crisis</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
