  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened maritime security concern drives operators and defense contractors to prioritize rapid fielding of autonomous surveillance and decision systems, shifting commercial and procurement incentives toward speed over exhaustive safety testing.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">red_sea_hormuz_crisis</data>
