  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in spot crude directly raises headline inflation and inflation risk premia (breakevens), prompting investors to demand higher yields on sovereign debt and pushing market yields up within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">red_sea_hormuz_crisis</data>
