  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in financial market volatility trigger cross‑border portfolio rebalancing, margin calls and redemption flows that directly increase short‑term volatility of capital moving between jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
