  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A jump in realized and implied market volatility tightens financial conditions by widening credit spreads, increasing margin requirements and reducing intermediation and liquidity, directly worsening the composite financial conditions measure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d39">red_sea_hormuz_crisis</data>
  <data key="d40">global_rate_market_shock</data>
