  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster corporate deployment of capable models increases availability of operational planning, reconnaissance and intrusion‑automation tools that state and proxy actors can repurpose to identify, target and execute cyber‑physical attacks on energy and transport infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
