  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating US–China tech rivalry leads Beijing to deepen political cover, trade concessions and selective materiel/dual‑use transfers to Moscow as leverage against Washington, increasing third‑party material and diplomatic support to Russia.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
