<edge source="global_rate_market_shock::sovereign_yield_level" target="brics_economic_realignme::external_financial_links" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in sovereign yields, especially driven by widening risk premia, prompts nonresident investors to trim exposures to domestic bonds and equities, narrowing the depth and resilience of external financial linkages.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">brics_economic_realignme</data>
</edge>
