  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden tightening of global financial conditions raises sovereign and corporate borrowing costs and market volatility, causing donor governments and private backers to delay or scale back arms transfers and budgetary aid to the Ukraine theater to avoid additional fiscal stress.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
</edge>
