  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A pronounced tightening of global financial conditions increases the domestic economic and market costs of additional restrictions for sanctioning states, reducing political willingness to impose broader or deeper sanctions in the near term.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_market_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_warfare</data>
