  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in cross‑border capital volatility triggers nonresident and domestic investor sell‑offs of sovereign bonds, raising required risk premia and pushing benchmark yields up.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">brics_economic_realignme</data>
  <data key="d40">global_rate_market_shock</data>
