  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater short‑term volatility in cross‑border capital flows creates funding uncertainty and investor short‑termism, which pushes firms to prioritize rapid productization and market capture over slower, precautionary safety processes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">brics_economic_realignme</data>
